x/onecx-ai-provider-ui/commit/9b4a5e7a65a010e5a3cec4782952ceafa29390ea","node_id":"C_kwDORMKTntoAKDliNGE1ZTdhNjVhMDEwZTVhM2NlYzQ3ODI5NTJjZWFmYTI5MzkwZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/commit/a3f514b691ab2a303a02bf12da0d1584d5218368","sha":"a3f514b691ab2a303a02bf12da0d1584d5218368","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/commits/a3f514b691ab2a303a02bf12da0d1584d5218368"}],"sha":"9b4a5e7a65a010e5a3cec4782952ceafa29390ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/commits/9b4a5e7a65a010e5a3cec4782952ceafa29390ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166110368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BenjaminPabst","id":166110368,"login":"BenjaminPabst","node_id":"U_kgDOCeakoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenjaminPabst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/commits/a3f514b691ab2a303a02bf12da0d1584d5218368/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T08:22:00Z","email":"166110368+BenjaminPabst@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Benjamin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T08:22:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement issue #594 - Configure voice-enabled agents (#83)\n\n* feat: add voice enablement and language to agent details\n\nExpose a voice enablement toggle and a controlled pilot-language select on\nthe agent details form. Saving with voice enabled but no language selected is\nblocked with an error message. The settings are read back on load and included\nin the save payload. Tool-rules policy behavior is unchanged. Adds the\nAGENT_DETAILS.VOICE i18n keys and Jest coverage for rendering, validation,\nsave/reload, and failure feedback.\n\nImplements https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\nWorkflow-Id: wf_af8e0186a726a9e79691\nWorkflow-Issue: 6:github18:https://github.com24:onecx/internal-tasks#594\nWorkflow-Executor: 14:Implementation14:Implementation18:git-implementation\nWorkflow-Issue-Url: https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\n* feat: add Antora docs and i18n voice language options\n\nAddress review findings on the voice pilot change:\n\n- Add an Antora documentation module (docs/) covering voice\n  enablement, the controlled pilot languages, and the canonical\n  tool policy (DENY, ALWAYS_ASK, ALWAYS_ALLOW) to satisfy the\n  Definition of Done.\n- Replace the hardcoded voice language options with i18n-friendly\n  labels so the pilot language dropdown is localized instead of\n  showing raw codes.\n\nImplements https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\nWorkflow-Id: wf_af8e0186a726a9e79691\nWorkflow-Issue: 6:github18:https://github.com24:onecx/internal-tasks#594\nWorkflow-Executor: 14:Implementation14:Implementation18:git-implementation\nWorkflow-Issue-Url: https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\n* fix: test coverage\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OneCX AI Workflow <ai-workflow@onecx.invalid>","tree":{"sha":"9d4f82ae25687ac8bd5b3ab25f77dcb62b2d39aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/git/trees/9d4f82ae25687ac8bd5b3ab25f77dcb62b2d39aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/git/commits/a3f514b691ab2a303a02bf12da0d1584d5218368","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d4f82ae25687ac8bd5b3ab25f77dcb62b2d39aa\nparent d149592de8f8fdc5851e8f62a25c0dc5bcd7ccdb\nauthor Benjamin <166110368+BenjaminPabst@users.noreply.github.com> 1790929320 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790929320 +0200\n\nfeat: implement issue #594 - Configure voice-enabled agents (#83)\n\n* feat: add voice enablement and language to agent details\n\nExpose a voice enablement toggle and a controlled pilot-language select on\nthe agent details form. Saving with voice enabled but no language selected is\nblocked with an error message. The settings are read back on load and included\nin the save payload. Tool-rules policy behavior is unchanged. Adds the\nAGENT_DETAILS.VOICE i18n keys and Jest coverage for rendering, validation,\nsave/reload, and failure feedback.\n\nImplements https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\nWorkflow-Id: wf_af8e0186a726a9e79691\nWorkflow-Issue: 6:github18:https://github.com24:onecx/internal-tasks#594\nWorkflow-Executor: 14:Implementation14:Implementation18:git-implementation\nWorkflow-Issue-Url: https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\n* feat: add Antora docs and i18n voice language options\n\nAddress review findings on the voice pilot change:\n\n- Add an Antora documentation module (docs/) covering voice\n  enablement, the controlled pilot languages, and the canonical\n  tool policy (DENY, ALWAYS_ASK, ALWAYS_ALLOW) to satisfy the\n  Definition of Done.\n- Replace the hardcoded voice language options with i18n-friendly\n  labels so the pilot language dropdown is localized instead of\n  showing raw codes.\n\nImplements https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\nWorkflow-Id: wf_af8e0186a726a9e79691\nWorkflow-Issue: 6:github18:https://github.com24:onecx/internal-tasks#594\nWorkflow-Executor: 14:Implementation14:Implementation18:git-implementation\nWorkflow-Issue-Url: https://github.com/onecx/internal-tasks/issues/594\n\n* fix: test coverage\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: OneCX AI Workflow <ai-workflow@onecx.invalid>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv2moCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARqoQAK4ZAHHU6b4e303MuRgjEOgI\nR/bi/cVsB+R6eey0NAJ07pzvnPAhXud5cNb1QYCbJWnCXdLbzDYXDl75dD0vlImp\n2kHeAO2l1x3DwV5KEiXVt5Op1xrN4dOoSSzlKa1WkNooYK8MNRNx56/J+pakBNOa\n7LkhqjRI5HHSyo0MAT9pRXoFborVGZ6H4bNZgcWTBuyLPQmP6ZdXcvPaZWaggXgQ\n9rsSijZFWS7aFd8x4hxUCQKR1snSoCo7qJK4A+rKTiRXAU/SSnVmazEcxhe364n9\nZC9D46poApUKR8+UO+BvF6r94F6mRzet1sdjqmuyYG5JAEnhX6bMkjTnGVl+qJri\nvSFwagK0BtAvVl9hR8NA1Xh55AP/bnLfZsQGMjkvyZW1/7/6CS7zsg91zBAqvOML\n064XWMgECWrMbMl7wNbfLxqvvvn/ny5t0BpDhNNEcg9VGNflFKvnSpl1BDe1nWUh\nRs0Fh9EV2MFXm3LT6luSygQICUwkF8o1oxU7QSV1OQdpci+KG4LVq9pN03RmxOAA\n5PwNVUqYEmJfjLFtx0/OFB1Ea51Vnhv9nInSA5v024oHVxnpU3rmWDX5unJeeAT2\n+IrwtHlXsnVBhNtBRwxWGoi2xc8AQdBG3vb0yUmk3V92HwYGRAc70LXrkuSlZWR0\n3K7kHOz/fYASaPEVJMox\n=dlYX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T08:22:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/onecx/onecx-ai