"https://api.github.com/users/qnowak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/commits/161acd79f5fbd143d98e7259a143c3e3dcbb6d78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:42:41Z","email":"51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kamil Nowak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:42:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: agent tools validation (#70)\n\n* refactor: move MCP tool rules from MCP server to agent level\n\n- Remove tool-rules component from mcpserver-details\n- Add MCP tool rules section to agent-details page\n- Update generated API client for new AgentMcpToolRule endpoints\n- Remove old McpToolRule generated models\n- Update openapi-bff.yaml and i18n translations\n\n* style: fix prettier formatting\n\n* fix: filter MCP tool select to agent-assigned tools and fix dropdown z-index\n\n- Tool Rules tab now shows only tools assigned to the agent\n  (vm.details?.tools) instead of all available MCP tools (vm.tools)\n- Add appendTo=body to permission dropdown to prevent footer clipping\n- Default permission for tools without rules changed from Allow to Deny\n  to match backend deny-by-default behavior\n\n* fix: update docker-spa-base to 2.35.0 to match main\n\n* refactor: fix SonarQube issues in tool-rules component\n\nAdd scope=\"col\" to table headers, remove empty SCSS file and styleUrls,\nfix redundant undefined type by importing DiscoveredToolAnnotations\ndirectly, and add comprehensive spec tests with 100% line coverage.\n\n* test: achieve 100% branch coverage in tool-rules component spec\n\nAdd tests for null-coalescing branches: null tool name, undefined orphaned,\nnull existingRule.allowed, undefined existingRule.id, undefined modificationCount,\nand undefined existingRule in deleteRule. Coverage now 100% statements,\nfunctions, lines, and branches.\n\n* test: add currentAgentId getter coverage tests\n\nAdd tests for the currentAgentId getter covering both the case where\ndetails are loaded (returns id) and where details are undefined\n(returns undefined).","tree":{"sha":"39f42268fab0df8d6aeb710b57753bffe6fa7cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/git/trees/39f42268fab0df8d6aeb710b57753bffe6fa7cf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onecx/onecx-ai-provider-ui/git/commits/161acd79f5fbd143d98e7259a143c3e3dcbb6d78","verification":{"payload":"tree 39f42268fab0df8d6aeb710b57753bffe6fa7cf2\nparent 617ef85c6c38e4f4b7f9a956650d05260eebe189\nauthor Kamil Nowak <51134450+qnowak@users.noreply.github.com> 1787830961 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787830961 +0200\n\nfeat: agent tools validation (#70)\n\n* refactor: move MCP tool rules from MCP server to agent level\n\n- Remove tool-rules component from mcpserver-details\n- Add MCP tool rules section to agent-details page\n- Update generated API client for new AgentMcpToolRule endpoints\n- Remove old McpToolRule generated models\n- Update openapi-bff.yaml and i18n translations\n\n* style: fix prettier formatting\n\n* fix: filter MCP tool select to agent-assigned tools and fix dropdown z-index\n\n- Tool Rules tab now shows only tools assigned to the agent\n  (vm.details?.tools) instead of all available MCP tools (vm.tools)\n- Add appendTo=body to permission dropdown to prevent footer clipping\n- Default permission for tools without rules changed from Allow to Deny\n  to match backend deny-by-default behavior\n\n* fix: update docker-spa-base to 2.35.0 to match main\n\n* refactor: fix SonarQube issues in tool-rules component\n\nAdd scope=\"col\" to table headers, remove empty SCSS file and styleUrls,\nfix redundant undefined type by importing DiscoveredToolAnnotations\ndirectly, and add comprehensive spec tests with 100% line coverage.\n\n* test: achieve 100% branch coverage in tool-rules component spec\n\nAdd tests for null-coalescing branches: null tool name, undefined orphaned,\nnull existingRule.allowed, undefined existingRule.id, undefined modificationCount,\nand undefined existingRule in deleteRule. Coverage now 100% statements,\nfunctions, lines, and branches.\n\n* test: add currentAgentId getter coverage tests\n\nAdd tests for the currentAgentId getter covering both the case where\ndetails are loaded (returns id) and where details are undefined\n(returns undefined).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkCKxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGjkQAKytwMf2hW/YjY44rxFLS68g\nvLZ3iGBqYuFylSaBB6rX/1S3Nk2++6atNSuVjU9wavHKt0sFgUVaX8QYnWedwfGj\nYMrPGg+9wkvg/620UBBosWIpqI/PtoTTIE7HF103+3ZYZqCzvZzsIvIw1aG2kLAN\nQPErU8Tbv9zYSyq/p/uuibFYE72QqJ1Ac243ezm37mnmjhO5laB77v3BwR/ewSyi\ngPsuid57YQKnXcx2uI6s002/NsUEDuloi1WCb1qA0jSmFCAV5LFpa7OJ9tZPuCqO\nuL9DOxrnczq9RzKpklWJapnFRsUCGqumpe/MkD/jC5txUHY6GH4pjEmfl8qUVE4N\nMQ0+9j3W0fu4eSeLDeNsmaiA4Ue5h6Oy8TvSonlOJov1xdJNpd6Cyr1sASo/u9Ao\niR5dA1FQRkGd4lgeej3I1fMwSfj3Bfp+d1TeHKfZ4m65Yxiy3eERicorN9nLmCv/\n/WvWSp81vOn6yzwnNDXBlgQFSgdv38yDBLeThXjvg6M1/4FcBSZL6VLp1seavqgy\nSC5MFJdnE3kaQG3gMmwJdH4LrArwAm7TCa3u4Q4pxAd3MZVAMDvNjFNd0hn/bUUI\nOdH4jhOZG8dqyzjvqh7mQB9RwCg0N+pyY0s7/Y83nDjhG45z/vLoE+vX/YILZrGz\npNA7GABG1BQ0ubZzf/b+\n=5GNE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T11:42:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a