email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"docs(policy): enrol the energy benchmark identity test\n\nThe previous commit changed tests/test_bench_energy_lif_dual_identity.py\nwithout enrolling it, which the docstring scope guard refuses. The file\ngains its module and test docstrings and joins the scope (794 files).\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"5f65bb065fd5a04597abdb09817d7755de50440e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/5f65bb065fd5a04597abdb09817d7755de50440e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/770d2c929571dea9b2631e6f8e34805fae5c95c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/770d2c929571dea9b2631e6f8e34805fae5c95c3","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDc3MGQyYzkyOTU3MWRlYTliMjYzMWU2ZjhlMzQ4MDVmYWU1Yzk1YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0","sha":"4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0"}],"sha":"770d2c929571dea9b2631e6f8e34805fae5c95c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/770d2c929571dea9b2631e6f8e34805fae5c95c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:52:43Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:52:43Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(tools): isolate the ABI consumer from an installed engine\n\nThe consumer environment put the outer interpreter''s site-packages on\nPYTHONPATH, ahead of its own. In a job that has the engine wheel\ninstalled there, the installed copy was loaded instead of the copy the\nenvironment exists to admit, and the origin guard refused it. The\ndependencies now come after the consumer''s site-packages through a\npath file.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"b145e63340995d4f5f96d93fef8c61c5e6471ef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/b145e63340995d4f5f96d93fef8c61c5e6471ef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDQ2NjJhNGIwNTVhNDdjZmFiMmNmMWNmY2VmYzExYWM0ZTA1MDE5YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99","sha":"48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99"}],"sha":"4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/4662a4b055a47cfab2cf1cfcefc11ac4e05019b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:52:42Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:52:42Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(bench): rebind two saved results and correct one expected count\n\nThe saved results of the non-resetting LIF and the SC non-resetting\nadaptive LIF benchmarks were bound to an earlier engine facade than the\none committed with them, so the source-binding test refused both. Both\nare measured again on the committed sources: five backends, traces and\nevent vectors equal to the Python reference, 4 and 577 events.\n\nThe SC normalized energy LIF record was regenerated earlier at the\ncommon 200000 steps, where every backend produces 1500 events; the test\nstill expected the 153 events of the previous 20000-step record. A\nfresh run confirms 1500.\n\nLocal regression measurements on a shared host; no speed claim.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"f38ba84861128d549da6687f7932ecc3ed8ee3d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/f38ba84861128d549da6687f7932ecc3ed8ee3d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDQ4YzVkY2M1MzcxZDcyMjgwYWM5MTdhYzRmOWRkMmQwMmQ0OTZkOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5","sha":"47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5"}],"sha":"48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/48c5dcc5371d72280ac917ac4f9dd2d02d496d99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:47:45Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:47:45Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(tools): keep build outputs out of the original Rust source image\n\nThe Rust documentation ratchet rebuilds the original sources in a\ntemporary Git image and then checks that the image''s source cohort did\nnot change. The image ignored only the test target directory. Without a\nredirected target, Cargo built inside the image and a dependency''s\ngenerated Rust file entered the cohort, so the hosted hook job reported\nchanged inputs. A global Git ignore for target/ hides this on a\ndeveloper machine; the new contract switches the global excludes off\nand uses a real generating build script.\n\nThe hosted hook job now also shares one target directory between the\ncurrent and the original build.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"6b633226d8fb8e9fdea88bcbff4a6deccda85536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/6b633226d8fb8e9fdea88bcbff4a6deccda85536"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDQ3Y2NmZTE1M2EwZWM0OWY5ZThmNTQ0NTQwOWU4OWM2OTdmOTFhZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/90a3e8fae4079318ff2a891c4048c80db6a9d59c","sha":"90a3e8fae4079318ff2a891c4048c80db6a9d59c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/90a3e8fae4079318ff2a891c4048c80db6a9d59c"}],"sha":"47ccfe153a0ec49f9e8f5445409e89c697f91ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/47ccfe153a0ec49