eal recording files, persisted checkpoint corruption, restricted Torch\nloading and successful worker lifecycles through public APIs.\n\nValidate 308 scoped cases, strict typing, documentation, security hooks\nand installed wheel behaviour; changed statements and branches are fully\ncovered. Existing frontend contract tests pass. Producer numerical ASTs\nare unchanged. No equivalent maintained native refusal surface or\napplicable numerical benchmark changes; hosted full CI remains pending.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 7e4a1","tree":{"sha":"e4cfa2e665a291e80a890aa66c679925a35b6f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/e4cfa2e665a291e80a890aa66c679925a35b6f73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/42114ee90266120894526313ead5e018a5a27fa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/42114ee90266120894526313ead5e018a5a27fa3","node_id":"C_k