r}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/fc3ed8775d7770fcdac31e577b6a995a7e1966ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:49:19Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:49:19Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(conversion): the Torch-free probe loads the declared base dependencies, not only NumPy\n\nOn Python 3.10 the isolated probe failed in CI: the conversion package\nreads its Julia settings with tomli, a declared base dependency below\nPython 3.11, but the probe''s package path held only NumPy and coverage.\nThe subprocess error was also hidden because check=True discarded stderr.\n\nThe isolated path is now built from [project].dependencies whose markers\napply to the running interpreter, linking each distribution''s top-level\nmodules from its installed file list (Python 3.10''s\npackages_distributions reads only top_level.txt, which NumPy lacks). A\nfailing probe reports its stderr. Verified on Python 3.12 (workstation\nvenv) and 3.10.21 with numpy 2.2.6, the CI versions for that job.\n\nParity: test only. Benchmarks: none affected.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"2c6e4f2d63f86234054af3736ee9f25e3e8c7e0e","url":"htt