s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/0f94dc41dee8356627c2078319fbeb5f7403f110/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:41:07Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:41:37Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(docs): evidence citations name commits reachable from main; the ledger test checks ancestry\n\nThe fidelity ledger cited four closure commits (SK, T-type, GLM x2) that\nexist only as rebased-away objects on the authoring workstation, so every\nCI clone failed test_every_public_fidelity_row_names_real_evidence. The\ntest used `git cat-file -e`, which passes wherever the stale objects\nsurvive; it now requires `git merge-base --is-ancestor <sha> HEAD` (the CI\ntest job checks out full history).\n\nA scan of all tracked Markdown found the same class in thirteen more\ncitations (five commits) across the cortical-column page and five\nbiophysical model pages. Each is replaced by its main-branch equivalent\nwith an identical patch id.\nTwo citations name the object that was actually verified or measured (the\n2026-05-25 green CI run and the quantum-annealing modularisation parent\nrecorded in the benchmark artefact); they are kept and now also name the\nreachable main commit, whose tree (or quantum-annealing sources) is\nidentical.\n\nParity: documentation and test only. Benchmarks: none rerun; the recorded\nartefact is unchanged.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"c45885aa063142e7e5b1cb11ba6c167efd30c3bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/c45885aa063142e7e5b1cb11ba6c167efd30c3bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/0f94dc41dee8356627c2078319fbeb5f7403f110","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/0f94dc41dee8356627c2078319fbeb5f7403f110","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDBmOTRkYzQxZGVlODM1NjYyN2MyMDc4MzE5ZmJlYjVmNzQwM2YxMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e","sha":"dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e"}],"sha":"0f94dc41dee8356627c2078319fbeb5f7403f110","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/0f94dc41dee8356627c2078319fbeb5f7403f110"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:36:00Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:36:00Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(security): measurement comparisons refuse with fixed sentences, never exception text (CodeQL #485)\n\nPOST /api/cohorts/measurements returned measured_pareto''s \"reason\", which\nwas str() of any caught KeyError, TypeError, ValueError or\nZeroDivisionError. A missing key echoed the caller''s key name and a wrong\ntype echoed Python type detail to a remote caller.\n\nThe comparison is now built by a helper that returns its authored refusal\nsentence instead of raising, and every structural fault (absent field,\nwrong JSON type, no held-out samples) becomes one fixed \"malformed\"\nsentence. No exception object is read on the response path. A receipt\nnaming a trial absent from the cohort result has its own refusal instead\nof the echoed key.\n\nTests cover four structural receipt faults, three malformed results and\nthe real HTTP route (fixed reason, no field name in the body, a valid pair\nstill comparable); the new assertions fail on the previous module.\nIndependent second-eye review: CLEAR on the exact patch.\nParity: Python-only surface, no counterpart in other languages.\nBenchmarks: no benchmarked path changed.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 56e9","tree":{"sha":"3fc2cfecadf6ed80bddeeacfc87ab0521b2d083b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/3fc2cfecadf6ed80bddeeacfc87ab0521b2d083b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKGRiZTc0Njg2ZWI1ZjI0ZGEzYzYxNzMxZjg3NjRlYWFhYjAwOGZhMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063","sha":"fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063"}],"sha":"dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/dbe74686eb5f24da3c61731f8764eaaab008fa1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:19:17Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:19:17Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(ci): Julia 1.13 hosted by a system-OpenSSL Python preloads its own libcrypto; the event-training page is in the nav\n\nThe second CI run on e568e7986 passed lint, frontend and test batch 1\neverywhere, then stopped in batch 2/3:\n- test_conversion_julia_native[1.13] failed on every Python leg:\n  \"version `OPENSSL_3.3.0'' not found (required by .../julia/1.13.1/.../libssl.so.3)\".\n  Julia 1.13 bundles an OpenSSL whose libssl needs 3.3 symbols; the\n  runner''s Python (actions/setup-python) links the system libcrypto 3.0,\n  which is already loaded when JuliaCall starts. It passed locally only\n  because the workstation''s uv Python carries OpenSSL 3.5 statically.\n  Measured with the system libcrypto preloaded: Julia 1.13.0 and 1.13.1\n  both fail; with the runtime''s own libcrypto first (then the system\n  one) both load. tests/julia_runtimes.juliacall_host_environment puts\n  the runtime''s libcrypto first in LD_PRELOAD for the six tests that host\n  JuliaCall, and docs/api/conversion.md states the requirement with the\n  same line for deployments.\n- test_docs_navigation_policy: docs/studio/event-training.md was in no\n  nav and unclassified; it joins the Studio section after the Training\n  Monitor.\nLocally with Julia 1.13.1 as the release runtime: the six JuliaCall test\nmodules and the navigation policy pass (65); pre-commit passes.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"2728e102b23612e1e12dbb1c09e4dccfed1018a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/2728e102b23612e1e12dbb1c09e4dccfed1018a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKGZjMTIzM2RiMjA0MGFlMTBlZjMxZjAyMzYwNDJmMDIzYWU0NDIwNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829","sha":"e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829"}],"sha":"fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/fc1233db2040ae10ef31f0236042f023ae442063"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:41:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:41:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(ci): the main CI job runs the native-parity suites it was given\n\nThe push of 2ad4560d5 turned SC-NeuroCore CI red. Its first test batch\n(of 12) stopped at 37 failures and 124 errors, all in accel/conversion\ntests landed with 9bae8e559 and the event-recording commits, which\nassumed a workstation: lint failed on one module too.\n\n- Julia runtimes: the parity tests found Julia 1.11 and the current\n  release only through Juliaup (`julia +1.11`, `julia +release`, a glob\n  under ~/.julia/juliaup, a \"1.13\" channel); hosted runners install Julia\n  with setup-julia and have none of these, so every one failed\n  (`SystemError: opening file \"+1.11\"`). tests/julia_runtimes.py resolves\n  a runtime from SC_NEUROCORE_TEST_JULIA_{1_11,1_13,RELEASE}, then\n  Juliaup, and fails with the variable to set; the 15 test modules use\n  it. CI installs Julia 1.13 before 1.11.9 (so juliacall keeps 1.11.9\n  first on PATH), checks both versions and exports the variables.\n- HDF5: the SHD readers link HDF5 (Go through `pkg-config hdf5` under\n  -tags=hdf5, Mojo by loading libhdf5_serial.so); CI installs libhdf5-dev\n  and pkg-config.\n- Offline Rust builds: the native safety crate tests build with\n  `cargo build --offline --locked`; CI now fetches each\n  accel/rust/safety/*_native crate''s locked dependencies first.\n- Mojo ISA pin: the repository''s own guard found eleven `mojo build`\n  argv lists in ten test modules not routed through pin_isa; they are.\n- Lint: mypy --strict in the lint job (no torch installed) rejects\n  studio/event_training_data.py subclassing torch''s Dataset (Any);\n  the module joins the existing torch-subclass override list with\n  training, qat and conversion.\n- The Julia DVS distribution test copied every *.py under src/, ignored\n  virtual environments included (accel/go/.venv holds a Go toolchain with\n  read-only files, so the second build''s copy failed); it now copies\n  git-tracked sources, as an sdist does.\n- Capability manifest regenerated (one more test-tree module).\n\nVerified locally in CI mode (variables set, Juliaup unused): the 15 Julia\nmodules 141 passed; the 95 non-Studio test modules changed since\nb7d8a0fc2 plus the ISA guard: 2524 passed, then the three distribution\ntests and the claims tests (27) after their fixes; mypy without torch\nreproduces the lint error before and passes after; actionlint and\npre-commit --all-files pass.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"acb23cbf7dcbb9abced272c3e481e56e8773da42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/acb23cbf7dcbb9abced272c3e481e56e8773da42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKGU1NjhlNzk4NjQ0OWI0YTcyODhmNTZmMTNkNGM4YWY1MDZiY2M4Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f","sha":"c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f"}],"sha":"e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/e568e7986449b4a7288f56f13d4c8af506bcc829"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:06:51Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:06:51Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(readiness): requalify the four RTL cosim receipts bound to the equation validator\n\n4cec714b8 changed src/sc_neurocore/neurons/equation_safety.py, a compiler\nsubject of every generated-RTL facet receipt (readiness._COMPILER_FILES),\nso the four current receipts sealed over it went stale. Each is\nre-recorded with tools/facet_receipt.py by re-running its declared\nevidence command on the committed tree, as 27f6bf484 did after the last\ncompiler change:\n- AdaptiveThresholdIFNeuron cosim (adaptive_threshold_if): passed, 19 subjects\n- BrunelWangNeuron cosim (brunel_wang): passed, 19 subjects\n- LapicqueNeuron cosim (lapicque): passed, 22 subjects\n- ResonateAndFireNeuron cosim (resonate_fire): passed, 18 subjects\nThe older receipts stay; the new files supersede them. The model profile\nand readiness evidence ledgers are regenerated (receipt names only);\nthe readiness and ledger tests pass (24).\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"4b46ea865dfc2e6ab1ca5472c39f3f851880640e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/4b46ea865dfc2e6ab1ca5472c39f3f851880640e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKGM2NmYyZTI3ZGY1NzFiMjE3ZWU2ZWRjMDg0MzE3OGU0MzU3N2JhMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a","sha":"4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a"}],"sha":"c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/c66f2e27df571b217ee6edc0843178e43577ba1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:04:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:04:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(security): equations refuse string constants, closing format-string traversal (CodeQL #484)\n\n- The CEO security review of CodeQL #484 showed the allowlist''s\n  documented guarantee was false: a string constant''s format field names\n  resolve attribute and index lookups the Attribute-node dunder rule\n  never sees. ''{0.__class__.__mro__}''.format(v) and\n  ''{0[__builtins__]}''.format(g) both passed the validator; the effect is\n  read-only disclosure (no call with chosen arguments was found), on the\n  library and Studio equation surfaces.\n- ExpressionSafetyValidator now refuses str and bytes constants\n  (equations are numeric) and, as a second barrier, the attributes\n  format and format_map on any object. The module docstring states it.\n- Corpus check before the change: 931 expressions across the 80 model\n  schemas and every from_equations/EquationNeuron call in src and tests\n  hold no string constant except two adversarial tests that must be\n  refused anyway. 626 equation, candidate, schema and DSL tests pass.\n- Tests: the two review probes at the validator and at the strict-units\n  sink, a bytes constant, a string inside a call, and format/format_map\n  on a non-string name.\n- equation_safety.py is a compiler subject of the generated-RTL facet\n  receipts; the four current receipts bound to it are requalified in the\n  next commit, as 27f6bf484 did after the last compiler change.\n\nReview: .coordination/handovers/SC-NEUROCORE/REVIEW_2026-09-30T0957_from_CEO_security_codeql_483_484.md\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"1f9736419ec0fe2e2e3629987b28d295afdb0e8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/1f9736419ec0fe2e2e3629987b28d295afdb0e8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDRjZWM3MTRiODE4MThjYzc5ZDdmMDc3MWU3ZmJhYjcyMTc1MjE3MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc","sha":"95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc"}],"sha":"4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/4cec714b81818cc79d7f0771e7fbab721752171a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:58:30Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:58:30Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(security): the strict-units check validates an equation before evaluating it (CodeQL #483)\n\n- EquationNeuron''s constructor runs the strict-units check\n  (prepare_strict_runtime → validate_quantity_expression) before the\n  neuron''s own AST allowlist exists, so with units=\"strict\" every\n  dynamics, reset and threshold expression reached eval unvalidated\n  (empty builtins only). No network route passes units=\"strict\"; the\n  reachability is the library API.\n- validate_quantity_expression now runs ExpressionSafetyValidator on the\n  expression at the sink, before compile and eval: the same allowlist as\n  every other equation eval site.\n- Six tests: a dunder chain through from_equations(..., units=\"strict\"),\n  and five direct probes at the sink (dunder, __import__, exec,\n  comprehension, lambda). All six fail without the fix.\n- Independent review: CEO/claude, CLEAR for this fix\n  (.coordination/handovers/SC-NEUROCORE/REVIEW_2026-09-30T0957_from_CEO_security_codeql_483_484.md).\n  The same review finds that format-string field names pass the\n  allowlist (read-only disclosure); that is #484 and is handled\n  separately.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"d9a96473703dc0eee25d4399ba7e4410e19e6697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/d9a96473703dc0eee25d4399ba7e4410e19e6697"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKDk1ZTVkMGRlODEzNzg5NzY2NGQzMzI2NTVhMDM5NWY2NGMwN2Y0ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6","sha":"f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6"}],"sha":"95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/95e5d0de8137897664d332655a0395f64c07f4fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:29:51Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:29:51Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(deps): pygments 2.21.0 in the fuzz lock; the docker login action names its pinned version\n\n- Dependabot #200 raised pygments to 2.21.0 in five locks; four carry it,\n  but requirements/fuzz.txt still pinned 2.20.0 with no recorded reason\n  (the lock targets Python 3.10, which 2.21.0 supports). Regenerated with\n  its recorded uv command and --upgrade-package pygments; only pygments\n  changes.\n- docker.yml pins docker/login-action to dbcb8138, which is the v4.6.0\n  tag commit, but the trailing comment still said \"# v3\".\n\nFound while establishing a disposition for every failed or cancelled\nDependabot run before the Actions history hygiene.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"39023d3716d1b7ab29823079f44273a0f2f2592a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/39023d3716d1b7ab29823079f44273a0f2f2592a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6","node_id":"C_kwDORM9tGtoAKGY2MzIxNzFhNjZmYjA5MDNiNTI2OTVhZDNhNzZhZGVlN2QxNzhhZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/sc-neurocore/commit/004b1b20ebde2f13c722f9437a426462e20ceef1","sha":"004b1b20ebde2f13c722f9437a426462e20ceef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/004b1b20ebde2f13c722f9437a426462e20ceef1"}],"sha":"f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/f632171a66fb0903b52695ad3a76adee7d178ae6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/commits/004b1b20ebde2f13c722f9437a426462e20ceef1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:10:45Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:10:45Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(deps): patched PyJWT in the Semgrep lock and brace-expansion in the Studio lockfile\n\nTwenty-one Dependabot alerts opened on the last push:\n- PyJWT 2.13.0 in requirements/semgrep.txt (via mcp and semgrep): ten\n  advisories (GHSA-9j54-fg26-wv3r, GHSA-8wjv-2p76-3863,\n  GHSA-hxm8-2xgr-2p9m, GHSA-ffc3-869f-jxw9, GHSA-w2cx-738m-mc7w,\n  GHSA-9v7f-9g4p-ffgj, GHSA-p4g4-x82p-q773, GHSA-r6x4-923q-g947,\n  GHSA-2gx3-rcp4-g85q, GHSA-w6j9-cwv2-h6wq), each raised against the .in\n  and the lock, all first patched in 2.14.0. Dependabot''s own security\n  update failed because Semgrep 1.177.0 (and 1.178.0) declares\n  pyjwt~=2.13.0. The reviewed override pins pyjwt==2.15.1 the way click is\n  pinned, semgrep.in states the floor, and the lock is regenerated with\n  its recorded uv command (only PyJWT changes). The CI scan, run locally\n  from the hash-locked set with --no-deps: Semgrep 1.177.0 with PyJWT\n  2.15.1 scanned 1852 files, 0 findings, passed.\n- brace-expansion 5.0.9 (GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr, medium, dev-only via\n  eslint → minimatch ^5.0.8): the lockfile entry moves to 5.0.12 with the\n  registry''s integrity; npm ci installs it and eslint passes.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b9f0","tree":{"sha":"6ec063111848b7779b3f2d14608031560a154624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/trees/6ec063111848b7779b3f2d14608031560a154624"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/sc-neurocore/git/commits/004b1b20ebde2f13c722f9437a426462e20ceef1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_a