ine in `flash_image_async` to pass the valid buffer length along with the buffer itself. This eliminates the need to `truncate` and subsequent `resize` (with zero-initialization) of the buffer in the hot loop, reducing CPU overhead during high-throughput flashing operations.\n\n- Changed channel type to `Result<(Vec<u8>, usize), AppError>`.\n- Removed `buffer.truncate(n)` in reader.\n- Removed `chunk.resize(...)` in writer.\n- Verified with existing tests.","tree":{"sha":"cd73063fd3b7736f5a55798ea2615bacf8fb3ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/trees/cd73063fd3b7736f5a55798ea2615bacf8fb3ecd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/commits/a9de3db6db1c5eade314cd63879bc72e3b67901d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58374576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zakarialabib","id":58374576,"login":"Zakarialabib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Mzc0NTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/commit/a9de3db6db1c5eade314cd63879bc72e3b67901d","n