 and USB writing.\n- Increases buffer size to 1MB (from 16KB) to reduce channel overhead and batch disk reads.\n- Uses double buffering (depth 2) to ensure the USB bus is always busy.\n- Adds real-time speed calculation to `FlashProgress`.\n- Reduces syscalls by using larger read chunks.\n\nThis optimization addresses the bottleneck where the USB bus was idle while reading from disk, significantly improving flashing speed for large firmware images.","tree":{"sha":"146f706ce6ef14f9a149875657702b940aee9607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/trees/146f706ce6ef14f9a149875657702b940aee9607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/commits/03ce6dfd1e94dd74dcf44da810588897c9a5f61e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58374576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zakarialabib","id":58374576,"login":"Zakarialabib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Mzc0NTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/commit/03ce6dfd1e94dd74dcf44da810588897c9a5f61e","node_id":