ove platform-specific device path validation\n\nRefactor `validate_target_device` in `phoenix-lib/src/flash.rs` to use\nidiomatic `#[cfg]` attributes instead of `cfg!` macros. This ensures\nthat the validation logic is correctly applied at compile time.\n\nBroaden the `/dev/` path requirement to all Unix-like systems while\npreserving Linux-specific protection for primary system drives.\nAlso update the corresponding unit test to remove outdated failure\ncomments.\n\nFixes a reported issue where non-/dev paths were incorrectly passing\npreflight validation on Linux.","tree":{"sha":"71caa083d91251541dbe5f3e32eae7dfb2c1af31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/trees/71caa083d91251541dbe5f3e32eae7dfb2c1af31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/commits/d7d157d7b44eeda04ad7e2bb35c6ac03405b7f5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58374576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zakarialabib","id":58374576,"login":"Zakarialabib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Mzc0NTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url"