3Z","email":"58374576+Zakarialabib@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Zakarialabib"},"message":"test: add unit test for extract_from_image utility\n\nImplemented `test_extract_from_image` in `phoenix-lib/src/backup.rs` to\nverify the offset and size logic for image extraction. The test covers:\n- Extraction from the middle of the file.\n- Extraction from the start of the file.\n- Error handling for requests exceeding file size.\n\nThe test uses `tokio::fs` for consistency with the rest of the codebase.\nUnused imports were also cleaned up.","tree":{"sha":"fa5d406c0287bb855b65b05fdd31ad2807a1e8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/trees/fa5d406c0287bb855b65b05fdd31ad2807a1e8c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/commits/98a319df1318dbb278c2e467e4d23fbe089fff90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58374576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zakarialabib","id":58374576,"login":"Zakarialabib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Mzc0NTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Zakaria