type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zakarialabib","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/commits/f8ab6861ea88d7924ac8f81d890d0a4cba889d5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-15T17:13:57Z","email":"58374576+Zakarialabib@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Zakarialabib"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-15T17:13:57Z","email":"58374576+Zakarialabib@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Zakarialabib"},"message":"Implement ADB-based live device scanning and fix compilation errors\n\n- Implemented `scan_live_device` in `phoenix-lib/src/security.rs`:\n    - Added device connectivity check using `adb get-state`.\n    - Implemented file existence checks using `adb shell test -e`.\n    - Implemented build.prop reading and package listing.\n    - Added robust error handling for ADB command execution.\n    - Added unit test `test_scan_live_device_offline`.\n- Fixed compilation errors in `phoenix-lib/src/flash_rockchip.rs`:\n    - Updated `get32le` usages to handle `Result` return type with `?` operator.\n    - Fixed undefined variable `buf` in `parse_rkfw` and `parse_rkfp` (replaced with `header`).\n    - Fixed type mismatch errors (usize vs u64) in `extract_to`.\n    - Updated `test_rkaf_short_buffer` to use `std::io::Cursor` for `Read + Seek` compliance.\n    - Resolved ambiguous `by_ref` method call.\n    These fixes were necessary to enable running tests for `phoenix-lib`.","tree":{"sha":"2ddeb650f27148270db2d9f96e053fd7e173bc29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/trees/2ddeb650f27148270db2d9f96e053fd7e173bc29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zakarialabib/Rust-Phoenix-Android-Tools/git/commits/f8ab6861ea88d7924ac8f81d890d0a4cba889d5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58374576?v=4","eve