on (shared scope protocol)\n- Angular 20 MFEs share via Native Federation (es-module-shims import maps)\n\nThe shell app is rewritten with dual loaders: a Module Federation loader that\ncreates a shared scope and initializes webpack containers sequentially, and a\nNative Federation loader that fetches remoteEntry.json, builds a deduplicated\nimport map, and loads exposed modules via importShim().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e36f96748d95c67e7e3173abd6b91cc6012ca2dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakeiiiii/microfrontend-demo/git/trees/e36f96748d95c67e7e3173abd6b91cc6012ca2dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakeiiiii/microfrontend-demo/git/commits/4e5a189bd034e6fdbe85d8ec0431025b2eb6af83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6539173?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bossiiiiii","id":6539173,"login":"Bossiiiiii","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzkxNzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bossiiiiii","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jakeiiiii/microfrontend-demo/commit/4e5a189bd034e6fdbe85d8ec0431025b2eb6af83","node_id":"C_kwDORNEQyNoAKDRlNWExODliZDAzNGU2ZmRiZTg1ZDhlYzA0Mz