76af06e3ae7cca668c1f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:31:50Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:31:50Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(css): global [hidden] guard — .sectionEmpty{display:flex} defeated the hidden attribute entirely\n\nTHE root cause of the whole empty-states saga: an author display rule on\nthe same element overrides the UA''s [hidden]{display:none}, so every\n.sectionEmpty stayed rendered as flex regardless of the hidden attribute —\nshowing its default HTML text (\"Run an Audit to see results\", capital A,\nexactly as reported) under populated tables, immune to every JS-side fix.\nThe probes were blind to it too: they checked el.hidden (true!) instead of\ncomputed style. Same bug class as round 23''s [hidden]-vs-display findings —\nthird occurrence, so the fix is systemic: [hidden]{display:none !important}\nrestores standard semantics globally (existing per-class fixups stay,\nnow redundant).\n\nVerified: computed-style probe across all six zones ALL OK; post-nav\nwindow shows \"Restoring last audit…\"; layout screenshot clean; 1297 tests;\ne2e-smoke 11/11.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc27f0eeab2d916b6903755aeb5ba4887dd1dc2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/fc27f0eeab2d916b6903755aeb5ba4887dd1dc2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/c7bca9a4e5ce44f9df976af06e3ae7cca668c1f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/c7bca9a4e5ce44f9df976af06e3ae7cca668c1f0","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGM3YmNhOWE0ZTVjZTQ0ZjlkZjk3NmFmMDZlM2FlN2NjYTY2OGMxZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/f83f2c41c480f8cc4867054028e0a1e432243e4e","sha":"f83f2c41c480f