":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:23:43Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(ui): run CTA derives \"ran\" from durable evidence, not the nav-wiped hasRunMode (6.10.6)\n\n\"Run an Audit to see results\" still appeared right after a finished audit:\nonNavigated (which the DH helpcenter fires post-audit) wipes hasRunMode,\nand any explorer render in that window classified the scope as never-run —\nwhile the audit sat right there in state.records. \"ran\" now counts any\ndurable evidence: hasRunMode OR current findings OR a run/observe record\nfor the scope. The CTA can only appear when nothing was ever run here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39ad55eb460a44c591f2566c423f95bfa908b5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/39ad55eb460a44c591f2566c423f95bfa908b5ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/8c5a62c9dd2e6b1991e1480116a4684bd255b391","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/8c5a62c9dd2e6b1991e1480116a4684bd255b391","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDhjNWE2MmM5ZGQyZTZiMTk5MWUxNDgwMTE2YTQ2ODRiZDI1NWIzOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/38625dad5c491c6d79b1e48f4d66992096ae8a04","sha":"38625dad5c491c6d79b1e48f4d66992096ae8a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/38625dad5c491c6d79b1e48f4d66992096ae8a04"}],"sha":"8c5a62c9dd2e6b1991e1480116a4684bd255b391","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/8c5a62c9dd2e6b1991e1480116a4684bd255b391"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"h