ithub.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/990f0f537031304651f44e02961fc439b1dffafd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/9d54485492048a1b49a3c0c6ab65910e79310c7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:49:00Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:49:00Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(review): Codex on #89 — totally-failed observe rejects; all-frames EXEC_FAILED = AUDIT_FAILED\n\nZero successful ticks resolved a normal result; the SW wraps any truthy\nresult as ok:true and nothing checks tickError — a fully-broken observe\ndisplayed/exported as a clean zero-finding audit. Now: observe rejects\nwhen no tick succeeded (SW surfaces it as EXEC_FAILED), and the\nall-frames-failed promotion generalizes: any all-failed run is AUDIT_FAILED\n(AUDIT_TIMED_OUT when a timeout was involved) instead of ok:true with a\nfailed bestEntry. Parallel-timing test mock updated to ok:true frames.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68a01e729a1e0b0cadf90334d9d0232b11b8236b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/68a01e729a1e0b0cadf90334d9d0232b11b8236b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/9d54485492048a1b49a3c0c6ab65910e79310c7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/9d54485492048a1b49a3c0c6ab65910e79310c7e","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDlkNTQ0ODU0OTIwNDhhMWI0OWEzYzBjNmFiNjU5MTBlNzkzMTBjN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e","sha":"52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e"}],"sha":"9d54485492048a1b49a3c0c6ab65910e79310c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/9d54485492048a1b49a3c0c6ab65910e79310c7e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:44:30Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:44:30Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(snippet): ReferenceError `win` killed every audit on chat-feed pages (6.10.3)\n\nTHE helpcenter hang root cause, straight from Piotr''s console paste:\nCHAT_SCROLL_REGION_NOT_FOCUSABLE used `win.getComputedStyle` — the window\nalias is `w`, `win` never existed. Pre-existing since caed2c2 and\nunreachable by DOM-less unit tests: the rule only executes when a VISIBLE\nscrollable role=log/feed exists (needs layout) — i.e. exactly on help\ncenters and chat widgets, the extension''s core use case. The throw aborted\nrun() -> observe tick 0 threw synchronously inside the promise executor ->\ncapture failed on every attempt -> recording appeared frozen on that step.\n\n- `win.` -> `w.` (the rule fires for the first time ever — live-verified:\n  CHAT_SCROLL_REGION_NOT_FOCUSABLE detected on a chat-feed fixture, run()\n  clean, observe settles at 1.8s, tickError null).\n- observe tick hardened: tick body wrapped, a throwing rule logs + retries,\n  3 consecutive failures finish early; first error surfaces as\n  result.tickError (fail loud, not a silent 12s of throwing).\n- Regression guards: snippet must never reference `win.`; tick wrap +\n  tickError pinned.\n\n1288 tests green; e2e-smoke rule counts unchanged (fixture has no visible\nscrollable log — which is WHY this survived until a live page).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e26018d3f27ad19e816e9772a3fb73644b732b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/1e26018d3f27ad19e816e9772a3fb73644b732b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDUyZmI2NDJjYmZlYjI1NGI4ODAxZTI0ZDlhMDI1MWQzMDU2NDdjMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/c7f0877ddd7ea3d8ddff48a1f6fbff5fcf3a35fd","sha":"c7f0877ddd7ea3d8ddff48a1f6fbff5fcf3a35fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c7f0877ddd7ea3d8ddff48a1f6fbff5fcf3a35fd"}],"sha":"52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/52fb642cbfeb254b8801e24d9a0251d305647c2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c7f0877ddd7ea3d8ddff48a1f6fbff5fcf3a35fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T09:48:44Z","email":"24290937+fski@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"