],"sha":"850ba0c3e51a529a3b9f75af1f13356d48d4a829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/850ba0c3e51a529a3b9f75af1f13356d48d4a829"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/7323489dced6bd84e227e1c7f9924b62aac0f56e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:51:08Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:51:08Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"perf(capture): faster settle confirmation — 600ms ticks, no blanket transition window (6.8.1)\n\nRound 2 of record-mode perf. The settle floor was ~4.5s on a static page:\n900ms ticks × (2 blanket transition ticks + 1 advisory->strict flip tick\nthat reset the quiet streak + 3 quiet ticks). Capture fires well after the\nnavigation (debounce + nav-settle), so the blanket transition window only\nproduced config-flip churn there.\n\n- observe() gains transitionTicks (default 2 == old `tickIndex <= 1`;\n  wiring test pins the default).\n- Capture-context observe passes intervalMs: 600, transitionTicks: 0;\n  per-container isLikelyTransitioning() still softens rules. Manual\n  observe and Snap RUN_AUDIT unchanged (probe-verified: 2 transition\n  snapshots, no early exit).\n- RUN_AUDIT + CAPTURE_STEP resolve frame targets and collect frame probes\n  concurrently (independent given frames; saves a scripting round trip).\n\nMeasured (headless Chromium, fixture): capture observe static\n4527ms -> 1826ms (12008ms before round 1); mutating page keeps the full\n12s window. Note: capture findings drop the transition-window advisory\nvariant of ARIA_HIDDEN_FOCUSABLE (kept: the strict variant) — it was an\nartifact of the blanket window, not page state.\n\nPanel post-processing benched at 3-8ms/step (30 steps x 80 findings) —\nleft untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2828a5fffe0001d344e472e32eaab1e1a5599e90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/2828a5fffe0001d344e472e32eaab1e1a5599e90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/7323489dced6bd84e227e1c7f9924b62aac0f56e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/7323489dced6bd84e227e1c7f9924b62aac0f56e","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDczMjM0ODlkY2VkNmJkODRlMjI3ZTFjN2Y5OTI0YjYyYWFjMGY1NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/a57176fb681c005a35ce923b846e357fdce9e4be","sha":"a57176fb681c005a35ce923b846e357fdce9e4be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/a57176fb681c005a35ce923b846e357fdce9e4be"}],"sha":"7323489dced6bd84e227e1c7f9924b62aac0f56e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/7323489dced6bd84e227e1c7f9924b62aac0f56e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/a57176fb681c005a35ce923b846e357fdce9e4be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:42:09Z","email":"24290