6-07-23T06:40:27Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"perf(capture): early-settle observe/watch + concurrent frame audits (6.8.0)\n\nRecord-mode step capture held hard fixed windows: observe 12s (watch 40s\nafter a blocking regression), multiplied by sequential per-frame execution\n(2 frames = 24s/80s per step) — while the audit itself costs ~3ms\n(measured). Two changes:\n\n- observe()/watch() accept opt-in settle params (settleTicks/minTicks,\n  settleMs/minMs). A capture-context window now ends early once the page\n  is provably quiet: no new unique findings AND no loader-ish DOM\n  mutations (watch: no loader/event/announcement activity). Full window\n  stays the cap; results carry settledEarly + elapsedMs (fail loud).\n  Manual console and Snap RUN_AUDIT paths are unchanged (settle off) —\n  there the user interacts DURING the window.\n- executeAuditAcrossFrames runs frames concurrently for read-only actions;\n  order stays deterministic. tabWalk remains sequential (focus is\n  tab-global). Bonus correctness: all frames now observe the SAME\n  post-transition window instead of staggered ones.\n\nMeasured (headless Chromium, fixture page):\n- observe static page: 12008ms -> 4527ms, findings identical (63)\n- observe mutating page: full 12s kept (no early exit)\n- watch quiet page: 40s -> 8004ms\n- 2-frame captures: windows overlap instead of doubling\n\nTests: capture-settle (predicates + wiring guards, incl. RUN_AUDIT must\nNOT opt in), capture-parallel (overlap timing, tabWalk sequential, order\ndeterminism, fastSettle arg propagation). 1238 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b6dd83d39884a8f6786d7dd9b16b00f94b4059a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/2b6dd83d39884a8f6786d7dd9b16b00f94b4059a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/d6c49fd14fef2c587276907f673813b20b609be9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/d6c49fd14fef2c587276907f673813b20b609be9","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGQ2YzQ5ZmQxNGZlZjJjNTg3Mjc2OTA3ZjY3MzgxM2IyMGI2MDliZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/7fc1a033b8b9ed15dcce45cae5702ef496deca7c","sha":"7fc1a033b8b9ed15dcce45cae5702ef496deca7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/7fc1a033b8b9ed15dcce45cae5702ef496deca7c"}],"sha":"d6c49fd14fef2c587276907f673813b20b609be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/d6c49fd14fef2c587276907f673813b20b609be9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/7fc1a033b8b9ed15dcce45cae5702ef496deca7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:18:53Z","email":"24290937+fski@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:18:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #82 from fski/fski/nav-port-tests\n\ntest(nav): flowlens-nav p