 re-announce) shipped untested in the wireup zone - one SW reap without\na working reconnect kills SPA auto-capture for the rest of the panel''s life.\ncreateNavPortClient(deps) now lives in the testable zone; wireup supplies\nruntime.connect and the nav-message semantics.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad2cc8cd3b0cb8bc73cc83dda42728925dbd739d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/ad2cc8cd3b0cb8bc73cc83dda42728925dbd739d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/59bfb98e0eaad0415a73892521fee19a0cab140d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/59bfb98e0eaad0415a73892521fee19a0cab140d","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDU5YmZiOThlMGVhYWQwNDE1YTczODkyNTIxZmVlMTlhMGNhYjE0MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/9ef2a7fa1f2963b060ae8895e83f6786b2c8de4d","sha":"9ef2a7fa1f2963b060ae8895e83f6786b2c8de4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/9ef2a7fa1f2963b060ae8895e83f6786b2c8de4d"}],"sha":"59bfb98e0eaad0415a73892521fee19a0cab140d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/59bfb98e0eaad0415a73892521fee19a0cab140d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.