"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/fc546723340d9b0a8d59096e08dca5db94ff51cc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/a2ecf5177cbd2f0ec7d5b3eb1903f1ca8f373667/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:25:26Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:25:26Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(flow): R4 — findingIndex covers run + active snapshots\n\nThe verdict numbers (stableSignatures, run+active) and the view''s\nAppeared/Persisting lists + lifecycle + issues-now (findingIndex, run-only)\ncould disagree on the same step. buildStepFindingIndex now maps active-mode\nitems (contrast failures -> CONTRAST_FAIL/high/1.4.3, tabWalk anomalies ->\ntype/medium-or-info/2.1.2, watch verdicts -> medium/4.1.3; confidence strict\n= deterministic checks, blocking classification stays aligned with the\nstable engine), and buildFindingIndexForStep merges both snapshots — used by\ncapture and the resume migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed0460d8a8967e45090172521fddcb4854e371a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/ed0460d8a8967e45090172521fddcb4854e371a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/a2ecf5177cbd2f0ec7d5b3eb1903f1ca8f373667","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/a2ecf5177cbd2f0ec7d5b3eb1903f1ca8f373667","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGEyZWNmNTE3N2NiZDJmMGVjN2Q1YjNlYjE5MDNmMWNhOGYzNzM2Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105","sha":"c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105"}],"sha":"a2ecf5177cbd2f0ec7d5b3eb1903f1ca8f373667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/a2ecf5177cbd2f0ec7d5b3eb1903f1ca8f373667"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:23:54Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:23:54Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(flow): R2+R5 — pure decideNavAction; nav flags grouped as sessionState.nav\n\nThe entire auto-capture precedence (no-session -> auto-off -> settle window ->\nforeign-site guard -> per-source dedupe) now lives in one pure function in the\ntestable zone, with unit tests for each precedence step — it used to sit in\nuntestable wireup where every comment documented a shipped regression.\nmaybeAutoCapture is a thin executor: nav-state writeback, debounce, and the\nforeign-skip status/toast side effects. Nav dedupe slots + skip telemetry\ngrouped under sessionState.nav (freshNavState() resets at start/end); full\ncapture FSM deliberately NOT built (assessed as over-engineering).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c24bea514e24560a83d66060beea18e201a711c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/5c24bea514e24560a83d66060beea18e201a711c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGMzMzkwM2JiYjc5MDMxNTQ0ODAxMTMwZDNiODJhZDNjMmYyMGYxMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec","sha":"c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec"}],"sha":"c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c33903bbb79031544801130d3b82ad3c2f20f105"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:21:47Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:21:47Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(flow): R1 — one diff engine (stable signatures); legacy bundle diff removed\n\nAfter the capture reorder the legacy branch was reachable ONLY for the\nbaseline step — two identity schemes that had to agree, and once didn''t\n(the deleteStep verdict flip). buildStepDiffs now always diffs stable\nsignature sets (defensive on-the-fly compute for steps that somehow lack\nthem); diffModeBundles deleted. mergeSignatureBundles/buildModeSignatureBundle\nstay — the systemic rollup still uses them. Baseline zeroing unchanged.\n\nFull suite green including the former legacy-fallback parity test — the\nunified path reproduces its numbers exactly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b425962bb66ef451d7a620197f5d25b4ce9d35b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/b425962bb66ef451d7a620197f5d25b4ce9d35b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGM3YWIzNjE4OWU3MTVlNjdmZmU0NjQ0ZWEyZGQ0NWZhOWY0NTZjZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f","sha":"b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f"}],"sha":"c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c7ab36189e715e67ffe4644ea2dd45fa9f456cec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:20:13Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:20:13Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(flow): R3 — uniqueRawRef, one appendix-ref scheme\n\nTwo hand-rolled copies of the ref-collision loop (session path cap 200,\nexport path cap 50) were the exact drift that silently orphans a step''s raw\nfindings. One helper, probe caps preserved per call site and flagged as\nprobably-unintended divergence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f84ace9fe4379fce3652fce773f3b451c5491b31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/f84ace9fe4379fce3652fce773f3b451c5491b31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGIyYmExODc1Zjc1MTZiZTlhZGM1ZDVmYmRmOTYxMjdkOTFjNTRjNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/8dd47b28f1eef0e2d80ab1ad4a1c7b36be0beec8","sha":"8dd47b28f1eef0e2d80ab1ad4a1c7b36be0beec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/8dd47b28f1eef0e2d80ab1ad4a1c7b36be0beec8"}],"sha":"b2ba1875f7516be9adc5d5fbdf96127d91c54c6f","url":"https://api.github.com/re