ithub.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/8ac4e7a93cd474ba7b0189c1c90ef97b1743dcd9","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDhhYzRlN2E5M2NkNDc0YmE3YjAxODljMWM5MGVmOTdiMTc0M2RjZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab","sha":"ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436","sha":"e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436"}],"sha":"8ac4e7a93cd474ba7b0189c1c90ef97b1743dcd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/8ac4e7a93cd474ba7b0189c1c90ef97b1743dcd9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:37:30Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:37:30Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): review round of #71-#75 — IP-literal guard, frame-nav dedupe/settle, End escape, export parity (6.5.2)\n\n3 reviewers + self-verification over git diff b22b7c8..HEAD. Confirmed findings, all fixed:\n\nNAV (P2/P3):\n- registrableDomain: IP literals compare whole — 10.1.2.3 vs 10.9.2.3 both\n  collapsed to ''2.3'', DEFEATING the privacy guard on internal deployments\n  (and over-skipping legit hops on other IP pairs).\n- Frame-nav settle window (2.5s after any top-level nav event): iframes\n  committing during a top navigation belong to that step — a slow-loading\n  audited MFE double-captured every top nav.\n- Per-source dedupe slots (lastAutoNavUrl vs lastFrameNavUrl): top and frame\n  URLs no longer alias/evict each other.\n- Baseline race: a first in-frame click during the baseline capture was\n  dropped (no audited set yet) — deferred once (1.5s) instead.\n\nUI:\n- Capture overlay carries its own ''End session'' button — it covered the\n  action bar, and a hung transport (send() has no timeout) would have left\n  the flow tab mouse-inert with no visible way out (keyboard ''e'' worked but\n  was unadvertised).\n- Overlay innerHTML write is idempotent — every render restarted the spinner\n  animation and re-announced the aria-live status.\n- Finding-group expansion persists in state (content-hashed group ids) —\n  every captured step collapsed whatever the user was reading.\n\nEXPORT/MISC:\n- runConfigSummary + diff-report reducedDiffConfidence use the SAME gated\n  predicate as the verdict header (suspect only with a profile in play) —\n  the loose copy made panel and CI disagree about one session.\n- flowRecorder: MediaRecorder construction failure now stops the acquired\n  stream (screen-share indicator no longer sticks) and reports ''failed''.\n- shotErrorReason capped at 200 chars; skip-frame nav log stores site only\n  (no third-party URLs in a privacy feature''s debug log); stray tracked\n  manifest.base.json.new removed.\n\nTests 1195 -> 1197.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"346d4e19f64c2103b5a0a038063438cb7a402b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/346d4e19f64c2103b5a0a038063438cb7a402b86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGU2ZmRiNjM1OTk1NmRmMTk0MjExZDdmN2FiOThlNDA0ZTk0ZDE0MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab","sha":"ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab"}],"sha":"e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e6fdb6359956df194211d7f7ab98e404e94d1436"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/ba8d26707292124183bdd06a31ec86ef3fcad7ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:26:38Z","email":"24290937+fski@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T12:26:38Z","email":