il":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"feat(flow): auto-capture skips third-party origins (privacy)\n\nDecision (Piotr, 2026-07-20): auto-captured steps include viewport\nscreenshots, and the third-party pages a flow crosses (SSO login, payment\ngateways) routinely display credentials/card data that must not land in\nIndexedDB. Auto-capture now skips navigations whose origin differs from\nsession.inspectedOrigin, with a once-per-session toast so the gap is loud,\nnot silent. Manual Mark on a foreign page still works (deliberate action).\nREADME updated; isForeignAutoCaptureOrigin is pure + unit-tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"443e66cc26ccea56892b4a8f8850fea94b3e2a71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/443e66cc26ccea56892b4a8f8850fea94b3e2a71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/6790ee99cc5a743827c5fc81bce34b494762f9be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/6790ee99cc5a743827c5fc81bce34b494762f9be","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDY3OTBlZTk5Y2M1YTc0MzgyN2M1ZmM4MWJjZTM0YjQ5NDc2MmY5YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/b22b7c8d7b2452e8d30de603271e5ab7fc9b10a4","sha":"b22b7c8d7b2452e8d30de603271e5ab7fc9b10a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/b22b7c8d7b2452e8d30de603271e5ab7fc9b10a4"}],"sha":"6790ee99cc5a743827c5fc81bce34b494762f9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/6790ee99cc5a743827c5fc81bce34b494762f9be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/f