},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/8f637f3ebe0150475bad47fd891bff1b44777faa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:40:34Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:40:34Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(flow): remove dead drill-down stack + shot-key single source + media record slim\n\n- Dead code removal (confirmed: zero callers, target #flowTimelineTable absent\n  from panel.html since the Flow rework): renderStepDrillDown,\n  buildStepDrillDownData, sessionState.expandedStepIndex, and all\n  #flowTimelineTable CSS (~190 lines).\n- stepShotKey(step) = single source for screenshot keys, used by the write\n  side (captureStepShot) and both read sites (filmstrip, step detail).\n- flowMediaStore.putShot: drop write-only w/h fields; fix stale key doc.\n- downloadFlowVideo: both-branches-identical ext ternary → literal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2ab9e3fe7b5b1eab669554aee6f3873efd449da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/c2ab9e3fe7b5b1eab669554aee6f3873efd449da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/8f637f3ebe0150475bad47fd891bff1b44777faa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/8f637f3ebe0150475bad47fd891bff1b44777faa","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDhmNjM3ZjNlYmUwMTUwNDc1YmFkNDdmZDg5MWJmZjFiNDQ3NzdmYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201","sha":"91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201"}],"sha":"8f637f3ebe0150475bad47fd891bff1b44777faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/8f637f3ebe0150475bad47fd891bff1b44777faa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:37:43Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:37:43Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"perf(flow): kill the 1s HUD re-render storm; cache screenshot object URLs\n\n- ensureSessionHudTicker removed (with hudTimer + dead formatElapsedHms):\n  it re-rendered the whole Flow tab and re-hydrated every screenshot from\n  IndexedDB once per second for zero rendered change — nothing in the Flow\n  view is time-dependent; every state mutation already calls renderSessionHud\n  explicitly (P2: per-second thumbnail flicker + N IDB reads/s).\n- _hydrateFlowShots: object URLs cached per (session, step) and re-applied\n  synchronously on re-render; revoked only on session switch. Also fixes the\n  overlapping-hydration race that could blank thumbnails and leak URLs (P3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"695943493f49264f8d5b79393f1ea59dfacd3669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/695943493f49264f8d5b79393f1ea59dfacd3669"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDkxYjFjYmI1ZmRkZGYwMWZiNmU0OTBjMWM4MTRkZDI0NTg2ZjIyMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0","sha":"e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0"}],"sha":"91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/91b1cbb5fdddf01fb6e490c1c814dd24586f2201"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:35:54Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:35:54Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): SPA nav port reconnects after SW reap + auto-capture prefs persist\n\n- connectNavPort: onDisconnect → reconnect with capped exponential backoff\n  (1s→30s), re-posting tabId; live SPA_NAV traffic resets the backoff. MV3\n  reaps the SW at will and every reap used to silently kill SPA auto-capture\n  for the rest of the panel''s life while full-nav capture kept working (P2).\n- autoCaptureNav/autoCaptureDelay persisted in uiPrefs (change listeners +\n  loadUiPrefs restore; undefined defaults ON so only a deliberate OFF sticks) —\n  a user who turned Auto off no longer gets it re-enabled on reload (P3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4992690f4a5ad75077ae57ed910318268b489745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/4992690f4a5ad75077ae57ed910318268b489745"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGUyYzE2NmQ2YjczMDMyYWIzOGM0OTNiOTY3ZjIxNzAwOTY2N2ZiYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6","sha":"eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6"}],"sha":"e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e2c166d6b73032ab38c493b967f217009667fba0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:34:48Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:34:48Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): media pipeline honesty — no orphaned blobs, no phantom hasVideo, Chrome-bar stop parity\n\n- captureStepShot: discard a shot that resolves after End/session switch —\n  the archived JSON already froze hasShot:false, so the write only orphaned\n  the blob in IndexedDB (P2).\n- flowRecorder.stop(): hasVideo only when putVideo actually succeeded; result\n  carries ''saved'' so the Stop button toasts honestly on quota failure instead\n  of ''Video saved'' (P3, fail-loud).\n- handleRecorderAutoStop(): stopping the share from Chrome''s own bar now\n  finalizes like the Stop button (UI reset + persist + re-render) — the button\n  no longer sticks on ''Stop recording'' and hasVideo survives a reload (P3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7fa5e2fb826361410896661726db330c34b9a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/b7fa5e2fb826361410896661726db330c34b9a9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGVhYWJiMWQzNmIyNjcwODAyMThjMTM5OTJlZjZkZWM0OWE0YTg1YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86","sha":"dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86"}],"sha":"eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/eaabb1d36b267080218c13992ef6dec49a4a85b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:33:12Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:33:12Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): lifecycle hardening — second R1 guard, session-scoped storage keys, honest End/delete\n\n- captureStepOptionC: re-check session identity after the deriveStepRouteHint\n  await (title-fallback branch yields to the event loop) — End in that window\n  crashed on null.steps; End+Start pushed the step into the wrong session (P2).\n- persistActiveSessionBestEffort/archiveSessionBestEffort key off the SESSION''s\n  origin+env (new sessionScopeKeys; session.env added at start, derived in\n  normalizeLoadedSession for older sessions) — cross-origin hops (OAuth,\n  hosted checkout) used to split the session across two active keys and leave\n  a resurrectable zombie under the original origin (P2, found independently\n  by two reviewers).\n- archiveSessionBestEffort returns ''in-flight'' for a concurrent archive;\n  endSession treats it as a silent no-op — double-End no longer shows a false\n  ''Archive failed'' toast (P3).\n- deleteStep: remaps positional selection, deletes the step''s screenshot\n  (new flowMediaStore.deleteShot), and reports persist failure instead of\n  silently claiming success (P3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e314754ca613aa4714e32acf4361e0c1b9650f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/e314754ca613aa4714e32acf4361e0c1b9650f6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGRjNjllZTEyMWE3N2RhYTk3NDBlMzJiMjdmMDAzZmMzMDYwOTBmODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3","sha":"706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3"}],"sha":"dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/dc69ee121a77daa9740e32b27f003fc306090f86"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:29:39Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:29:39Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): single blocking predicate + first-step baseline + critical severity\n\n- computeStableSignatureSet + migrateStepStableSignatures classify blocking via\n  isRunFindingBlocking (confidence-aware) — the bare high|medium check made\n  deleteStep''s recompute flip the Flow verdict PASS<->FAIL vs capture (P1).\n- captureStepOptionC computes stableSignatures BEFORE buildStepDiffs so capture\n  and deleteStep diff with the same engine; validateDiffParity (now a\n  stable-vs-stable tautology) removed.\n- buildStepDiffs(step, null): first step is a baseline — blocking deltas zeroed\n  at the producer (the #66 test only covered the reader) (P2).\n- critical severity: blocking (advisory still demotes), counted, SEV_SCORE=8,\n  severityWeight=4 (latent).\n- stable consolidated.countsDelta merges run+active severity counts (P3).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cbefb67850d7953aced88607729792d5edaaef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/8cbefb67850d7953aced88607729792d5edaaef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDcwNmJkZGE3YjExMzI1NWU2NThiZDhjMTAzYjUyMzliYWM1MzMwZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/f136b786222bf884385f388aba2167d89b08b0b8","sha":"f136b786222bf884385f388aba2167d89b08b0b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/f136b786222bf884385f388aba2167d89b08b0b8"}],"sha":"706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/706bdda7b113255e658bd8c103b5239bac5330e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsk