/flowlens/commit/c83337a29f393d1f61c1446ece4d9935a66cab1e","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGM4MzMzN2EyOWYzOTNkMWY2MWMxNDQ2ZWNlNGQ5OTM1YTY2Y2FiMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/49e475700d0afd08402ca9aed4bf1711ff426d74","sha":"49e475700d0afd08402ca9aed4bf1711ff426d74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/49e475700d0afd08402ca9aed4bf1711ff426d74"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d","sha":"3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d"}],"sha":"c83337a29f393d1f61c1446ece4d9935a66cab1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/c83337a29f393d1f61c1446ece4d9935a66cab1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:28:10Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:28:10Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): make sessions endable + progressive-disclosure UI (6.2.0)\n\nRoot causes of \"can''t end it\" + information overload:\n\n- endSession never re-rendered the Flow view: after current=null the HUD\n  ticker stops and no renderFlow ran, so the results area stayed frozen on\n  the active session''s last frame and End looked like it did nothing. Now\n  endSession calls renderSessionHud() and clears selection/inFlight.\n- The End button was disabled by panelBusy (inFlight || running), so a\n  running/queued auto-capture kept it disabled — the flow felt un-endable.\n  End is now gated only on hasSession; an in-flight capture discards its own\n  result via the existing session-id guard. Removed a dead\n  expandAccordion(#flowTimeline) call (element deleted in the rework).\n\n- Overload: the Flow view now uses progressive disclosure. Default visible =\n  slim verdict header (badge + step count + Issues now + Blocking) + step\n  list + selected-step detail. Filmstrip and issue-lifecycle swimlane are\n  collapsed under toggles (with counts), revealed on demand. New-total /\n  worst-step dropped from the header (discoverable in the step list).\n\nVersion 6.2.0. New flow-end-and-view.test.mjs; 1149 green; dist E2E verifies\nEnd-during-capture, re-render on end, default-collapsed sections + toggle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92ce7220f755e2d947e50e91a94dc61464a24789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/92ce7220f755e2d947e50e91a94dc61464a24789"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDM1NzhmMzliZDk2Y2IwMTk5NWFkMzYxOWQ5OGJhMWU5MDc1ZTM1NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/49e475700d0afd08402ca9aed4bf1711ff426d74","sha":"49e475700d0afd08402ca9aed4bf1711ff426d74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/49e475700d0afd08402ca9aed4bf1711ff426d74"}],"sha":"3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/3578f39bd96cb01995ad3619d98ba1e9075e356d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organiza