w","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/84b30b06ebfc780dc7536af53bbb123f7c3e2972","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDg0YjMwYjA2ZWJmYzc4MGRjNzUzNmFmNTNiYmIxMjNmN2MzZTI5NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/adce75cacf4fa490226831678b545387a92753f7","sha":"adce75cacf4fa490226831678b545387a92753f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/adce75cacf4fa490226831678b545387a92753f7"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0","sha":"62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0"}],"sha":"84b30b06ebfc780dc7536af53bbb123f7c3e2972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/84b30b06ebfc780dc7536af53bbb123f7c3e2972"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:47:54Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:47:54Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(panel): parked audit unifications + dead-diagnostics fix (6.1.2)\n\n- Fix real bug: diagFrameGating / diagExcludedFrames / diagDepth3Engine were\n  read by renderDiagnostics but missing from els (and one had no HTML row),\n  so three diagnostics rows never populated. Registered + added the row.\n- isCrossFrameFinding(f): one predicate replacing 3 lockstep inline copies\n  (row badge, detail Scope line, highlight gating).\n- UNKNOWN_FRAME_KEY constant replacing the repeated sentinel literal.\n- currentBestEntry() replacing `state.lastResult?.bestEntry || …best` (5×).\n- flashInlineHint() reused for the 4 copyDiagHint handlers (was open-coded\n  with a divergent 2000ms timeout and no .show class).\nVersion 6.1.2; new tests in panel-unifications.test.mjs; 1145 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b13b212cd1d3f10f54ee2653ad3180c7cecc8a76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/b13b212cd1d3f10f54ee2653ad3180c7cecc8a76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDYyZWFiYTBiNDVhNzhkZDY3MzBkYTQ5ZTIxYWIyYjYyZTVkMDE4ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/e4037131338d9c4eecbdc6ab330d14e60fa9b907","sha":"e4037131338d9c4eecbdc6ab330d14e60fa9b907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e4037131338d9c4eecbdc6ab330d14e60fa9b907"}],"sha":"62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/62eaba0b45a78dd6730da49e21ab2b62e5d018e0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/e4037131338d9c4eecbdc6ab330d14e60fa9b907/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:44:44Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T08:44:44Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"fix(flow): address Codex review of PR #65 (6.1.1)\n\nP1 (correctness):\n- Blocker classification now uses the shared confidence-aware\n  isRunFindingBlocking predicate (confidence stored in findingIndex), so\n  the Flow verdict/unresolved filter agree with Snap + CI (medium is\n  blocking only at strict confidence).\n- Regression totals use the authoritative step.diffs.consolidated\n  .blockingAdded — a baseline step''s findings no longer report as\n  \"blocking introduced\"/FAIL.\n- normalizeLoadedSession synthesizes findingIndex from the run snapshot for\n  sessions persisted before the rework, so resumed flows show real issues\n  instead of an empty PASS.\n- Screenshots keyed by the stable step.id, not the mutable step.index —\n  deleting an earlier step no longer makes later steps load the wrong image.\n\nP2:\n- Recorded video is retrievable: manual Stop downloads the webm, and a\n  \"⤓ Video\" control in the verdict header downloads a stored recording\n  (getVideo) for an ended session.\n- The per-step screenshot marker is persisted after the async capture\n  completes, so hasShot survives a DevTools reload.\n\nVersion 6.1.1. New tests in flow-codex-fixes.test.mjs; 1142 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ea270491c4eb8e2a8ab9d2e725e4c75686edc98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/0ea270491c4eb8e2a8ab9d2e725e4c75686edc98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/e4037131338d9c4eecbdc6ab330d14e60fa9b907","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/e4037131338d9c4eecbdc6ab330d14e60fa9b907","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGU0MDM3MTMxMzM4ZDljNGVlY2JkYzZhYjMzMGQxNGU2MGZhOWI5MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/adce75cacf4fa490226831678b545387a92753f7","sha":"adce75cacf4fa490226831678b545387a92753f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/adce75cacf4fa490226831678b545387a92753f7"}],"sh