mail":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(ui): results-shell view machine + sev-tab button dedupe, 6.0.3\n\nThird unification pass, same \"no random states\" principle one level up:\n\n- renderResultsShell({view}) is the single writer for the Snap body''s\n  idle / results / error state. updateResultsVisibility and\n  showErrorEmptyState are now thin wrappers over it. Fixes a latent\n  stuck-error: the old idle path never cleared a prior error''s text,\n  class or retry button — error → idle now resets cleanly.\n- Empty-state copy centralized in RESULTS_SHELL_COPY (was inline strings\n  duplicated across the two functions).\n- sevTabButton(): one filter-tab template shared by the severity strip\n  and the contrast all/fail/pass strip (byte-identical markup before).\n- Status-surface contract documented above toast(): toast /\n  renderSaveStatus / renderResultsShell(error) / setPersistentStatus —\n  pick by lifetime and blocking-ness.\n- Version 6.0.3.\n\nSuite 1129 (+9); full CI green; Playwright E2E on dist/panel.html 6/6\nincl. the error→idle stuck-state regression.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20f1df4b982e6113a7081f299f5dc31e4e6149cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/20f1df4b982e6113a7081f299f5dc31e4e6149cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/731a4846fef0ca40957504362a7a90df0a959e9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/731a4846fef0ca40957504362a7a90df0a959e9b","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDczMWE0ODQ2ZmVmMGNhNDA5NTc1MDQzNjJhN2E5MGRmMGE5NTllOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/f322cadd3dcb44880436bfa12e223d4fc3a02ef9","sha":"f322cadd3dcb44880436bfa12e223d4fc3a02ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/f322cadd3dcb44880436bfa12e223d4fc3a0