b-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/f322cadd3dcb44880436bfa12e223d4fc3a02ef9","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKGYzMjJjYWRkM2RjYjQ0ODgwNDM2YmZhMTJlMjIzZDRmYzNhMDJlZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/2b1d560cba29e6535fec4db4f2ab2f229b414e95","sha":"2b1d560cba29e6535fec4db4f2ab2f229b414e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/2b1d560cba29e6535fec4db4f2ab2f229b414e95"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7","sha":"5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7"}],"sha":"f322cadd3dcb44880436bfa12e223d4fc3a02ef9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/f322cadd3dcb44880436bfa12e223d4fc3a02ef9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T06:56:52Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T06:56:52Z","email":"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"refactor(ui): MODES registry + name-keyed column prefs + CTA dedupe, 6.0.2\n\nUnification pass on top of the section-view core (#62):\n\n- MODES registry in panel-00-core: one table for per-mode label, color,\n  duration, progress/busy text and CTA config. Replaces six independently\n  drifting lookups (MODE_LABELS, MODE_COLORS, DURATIONS, PROGRESS_LABELS,\n  SNAP_CTA, SNAP_CTA_RERUN, inline busyLabels). Completeness enforced by\n  test/modes-registry.test.mjs.\n- applySnapCta(): setRunButtonBusy(false) and updateSnapCta shared two\n  hand-maintained copies of the idle-CTA restore — now one function.\n- Column visibility keyed by column NAME, not index: index-keyed prefs\n  silently shifted meaning when the APCA column landed (saved toggles hit\n  the wrong columns). Legacy numeric prefs fail validation and are dropped.\n- CSS: .settingsHeading merged into the .aboutHeading rule (was a copy).\n- Version 6.0.2.\n\nSuite 1120 green (+3 registry tests); Playwright E2E on dist/panel.html\n8/8 (registry-driven CTA/busy/idle, legacy-pref drop, name-keyed toggle\ntargeting the right nth-child).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6b06e0f945ceea1268dd41b5927835978076b1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/f6b06e0f945ceea1268dd41b5927835978076b1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDU2OTBjZWI5NWVhZjkwMzZjNDBjN2NmMzdmNTU4OTdkNzMxOGE5ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/2b1d560cba29e6535fec4db4f2ab2f229b414e95","sha":"2b1d560cba29e6535fec4db4f2ab2f229b414e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/2b1d560cba29e6535fec4db4f2ab2f229b414e95"}],"sha":"5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/5690ceb95eaf9036c40c7cf37f55897d7318a9e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24290937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fski","id":24290937,"login":"fski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkwOTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fski/orgs","received_event