"fski@tekhne.tail1f1dd6.ts.net","name":"Piotr Fijalkowski"},"message":"feat(ui): v10 polish — tab walk stops list, empty-state sync, settings cleanup, 6.0.0\n\n- Tab Walk: snippet returns walked stops (one row per element, anomalies\n  merged in + flagged); page overlay lives 30s instead of 8s\n- Empty states: computed synchronously with table data and recomputed on\n  every subtab switch — no more empty state showing on top of results\n- Contrast: fix off-by-one column widths + column toggle list after the\n  APCA column landed (9 cols, not 8); tables get min-widths and scroll\n  in their wrap instead of crushing flexible columns\n- Results zone: shadow-coverage receipt removed (still in diagnostics);\n  integrity pills hidden at zero count, whole bar hidden when all clean\n- Settings: grouped into Audit/Targeting/Output with per-option hints;\n  profile pills sorted (built-ins first, then custom, alphabetical)\n- Version 6.0.0 (version.js, package.json)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8537fd403ce2c2e77471b95372e563c005c4ba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/trees/a8537fd403ce2c2e77471b95372e563c005c4ba2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/git/commits/9db8a7df9a1888cae4208b3dd88f637c93be7dd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/9db8a7df9a1888cae4208b3dd88f637c93be7dd5","node_id":"C_kwDORNl4xNoAKDlkYjhhN2RmOWExODg4Y2FlNDIwOGIzZGQ4OGY2MzdjOTNiZTdkZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fski/flowlens/commit/b4b23afa7869dd3355e5216bd36104197ca8b02f","sha":"b4b23afa7869dd3355e5216bd36104197ca8b02f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/b4b23afa7869dd3355e5216bd36104197ca8b02f"}],"sha":"9db8a7df9a1888cae4208b3dd88f637c93be7dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fski/flowlens/commits/9db8a7df9a1888cae4208b3dd88f637c93be7dd5"},{