2-18T01:49:54Z","email":"jchaffin@ucla.edu","name":"Jacob Chaffin"},"message":"Latency observer, Sarah/Mike configs, two-agent dev server\n\n- latency.py: custom LatencyMetricsObserver with TTFB, processing,\n  E2E, and per-turn metrics sent to frontend via WebSocket relay\n- mike.py: SmartTurn v3 (stop_secs=3.0), VAD (0.8s), no interrupts\n- sarah.py: VAD only (1.5s), interruptions enabled\n- dev.py: WebSocket relay at /ws, metrics ingestion at /api/metrics\n- Updated Dockerfile and requirements for new files\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c5ff56467c6ac6a382d64bda35223425ed2fa15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchaffin/bottalk-agents/git/trees/1c5ff56467c6ac6a382d64bda35223425ed2fa15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchaffin/bottalk-agents/git/commits/f912f14bd2d61031314b8644b19975a2cb40133d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18356905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jchaffin","id":18356905,"login":"jchaffin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzU2OTA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jchaffin/bottalk-agents/commit/f912f14bd2d61031314b8644b19975a2cb