://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchaffin/bottalk-agents/commits/87aaf765511a3515ae6bbca1a11fe14064b7852a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T02:25:38Z","email":"jchaffin@ucla.edu","name":"Jacob Chaffin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T02:25:38Z","email":"jchaffin@ucla.edu","name":"Jacob Chaffin"},"message":"Fix: enable transcription for both agents, filter cross-agent app-messages\n\nTwo bugs:\n1. capture_participant_transcription() silently no-ops when\n   transcription_enabled=False — Mike never received transcription.\n   Fix: set transcription_enabled=True for both; monkey-patch\n   start_transcription to a no-op on the second agent to avoid\n   UserMustBeAdmin.\n\n2. On PCC, custom outrival app-messages from LLMTextRelay fail RTVI\n   validation on the receiving agent, flooding errors and choking the\n   pipeline. Fix: patch on_app_message to drop outrival-labelled\n   messages before they reach RTVI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"91ca4cf0cf166480c15f259dc51d741d6894bc79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchaffin/bottalk-agents/git/trees/91ca4cf0cf166480c15f259dc51d741d6894bc79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchaffin/bottalk-agents/git/commits/87aaf765511a3515ae6bbca1a11fe14064b7852a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18356905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jchaffin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jchaffin","id":18356905,"login":"jchaffin","no